{
    "title": "Word Universe - CrossWord",
    "description": "Tired of daily challenges? Now it\u2019s the time to relax yourself with Word Universe! \r\n\r\nWhile the beautiful scenery backgrounds and music smoothes you, you will learn new words, challenge your brain and improve your vocabulary by finding hidden words. Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home and relax your brain. We promise you'll say WOW!\r\n\r\nThis crossword puzzle starts easy and becomes challenging fast! Word Universe will test your vocabulary as you discover the wonders filled with challenging levels. It's a great fit for fans of word connect, word hunt and word anagram games.\r\n\r\n\r\nWORD UNIVERSE FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf You need to connect letters within the word wheel to find all the hidden words by filling the horizontal and vertical gaps in the puzzle. \ud83c\udfaf\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc46 To create words, you can swipe between the letters located in the word wheel on the lower portion of the game. \ud83d\udc46\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0e If you get stuck, you can use hint or auto-solver. When you press the bulb button, it will give you one letter to help you to solve the puzzle and when you press \"\"magnifying glass\"\"  icon, it will give you one word to help you to solve the jigsaw. \ud83d\udd0e\r\n\r\n\u2b50\ufe0f You can receive extra coin for each bonus word you find! \u2b50\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\u2139\ufe0f You can learn engrossing information within the Academy. Complete Academy to get new rewards. \u2139\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1ALSO: You can get hints by watching rewarded videos or making purchase.\ud83d\udca1\r\n\r\n\r\nWord Universe is FREE to play word find game. Download and find hidden words!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy and Terms: https://www.librasoftworks.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Tired of daily challenges? Now it\u2019s the time to relax yourself with Word Universe! <br><br>While the beautiful scenery backgrounds and music smoothes you, you will learn new words, challenge your brain and improve your vocabulary by finding hidden words. Unlock stunning landscape backgrounds to escape from home and relax your brain. We promise you&#39;ll say WOW!<br><br>This crossword puzzle starts easy and becomes challenging fast! Word Universe will test your vocabulary as you discover the wonders filled with challenging levels. It&#39;s a great fit for fans of word connect, word hunt and word anagram games.<br><br><br>WORD UNIVERSE FEATURES:<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf You need to connect letters within the word wheel to find all the hidden words by filling the horizontal and vertical gaps in the puzzle. \ud83c\udfaf<br><br>\ud83d\udc46 To create words, you can swipe between the letters located in the word wheel on the lower portion of the game. \ud83d\udc46<br><br>\ud83d\udd0e If you get stuck, you can use hint or auto-solver. When you press the bulb button, it will give you one letter to help you to solve the puzzle and when you press &quot;&quot;magnifying glass&quot;&quot;  icon, it will give you one word to help you to solve the jigsaw. \ud83d\udd0e<br><br>\u2b50\ufe0f You can receive extra coin for each bonus word you find! \u2b50\ufe0f<br><br>\u2139\ufe0f You can learn engrossing information within the Academy. Complete Academy to get new rewards. \u2139\ufe0f<br><br>\ud83d\udca1ALSO: You can get hints by watching rewarded videos or making purchase.\ud83d\udca1<br><br><br>Word Universe is FREE to play word find game. Download and find hidden words!<br><br>Privacy Policy and Terms: https://www.librasoftworks.com/privacy-policy",
